        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, thermal insulation, 30mm, 40kg/m3, alumium cladding</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, thermal insulation, 30mm, 40kg/m3, alumium cladding
Disposal of a thermal insulation of ventilation duct, made of 40 kg/m3 rock wool, insulation thickness 30 mm, total weight: 3.5 kg/m2. Including cover with 0.8 mm aluminium cladding. Reference value of inventory is m2 area of duct surface.;
UUID: 95558e32-41f3-41eb-9552-3aaf6ae97005
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_95558e32-41f3-41eb-9552-3aaf6ae97005.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
